  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T04:21:47.287454Z",
  "totalBlocks": 33,
  "translatedBlocks": 33,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "560c8d83d2169f3c",
      "translationZh": "MiMo-V2.6-Pro 在 AA 上拿到了高得离谱的 46 分，位居现有开源模型之首。它的成本也低得只要几美分。Flash 还没有出现在 AA 上，但在数据中心运行的成本不到前者的一半，在 Xiaomi 自己的基准测试中表现则略逊一筹。它还能装进 192GB 的内存，这让它成为 Gorgon Halo 的第一个真正的应用场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb458f6356bed794",
      "translationZh": "所以我试了这两个模型。这不是基准测试，而是一名资深软件工程师基于专业经验得出的印象。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db665cdf798a48ff",
      "translationZh": "我给了它一个以安全为重点的任务：让 bubblewrap 沙箱能够向 github 执行 git push，但不能执行 git push --force 或其他破坏性命令。启动沙箱时，可选标志 --no-git 会完全禁用对 github 的写入权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "466d19419c654f38",
      "translationZh": "它发现设计中有一些不明确的边界情况，于是停下来向我提问 🥇，然后继续进行实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "484a1639427b8703",
      "translationZh": "它很慢，但这只是推理方面的问题（约 25 tok/s），随着更多服务提供商上线，应该会在几天内得到解决。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76591791ad9718fb",
      "translationZh": "然后我读了它的输出，惊得下巴都掉到了地上，不得不把它捡起来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54ac8099a70bafe8",
      "translationZh": "只是极其快速地扫了一眼代码，我就立刻发现，要绕过 --no-git，你得在沙箱内执行下面这个极其复杂、极其罕见的命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62a45a3526f410e9",
      "translationZh": "这就是 15 岁脚本小子的水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e57c403889f8a255",
      "translationZh": "我没再往下读。我让 GLM-5.3（完整版）对这次改动做一次安全审查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "418ac3cf2302cb15",
      "translationZh": "3 分钟内，它就找出了九个明显的安全漏洞，能绕过 git 和 gh 的限制。下面几个例子让我气得想把头发都揪下来：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6a65a7b8a8c4dcb",
      "translationZh": "在默认的受限模式下，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fee9faeec5f27b6b",
      "translationZh": "git push --force 被拦截了 🥇",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae8a993583871507",
      "translationZh": "git push -f 被拦截了 🥇",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b9e0588b4204c16",
      "translationZh": "git push -uf 却能让你轻轻松松清空 git 远程仓库。☠️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f4759421ac551bec",
      "translationZh": "git config alias.fp 'push --force --no-verify && git fp 也能通过 ☠️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a7802294a02fe47f",
      "translationZh": "env -u GIT_CONFIG_COUNT /usr/bin/git push --force 直接突破限制 ☠️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32d86edf7a03582f",
      "translationZh": "再说一遍。这种无能程度，简直就是个满脸青春痘的实习生。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96d874dc0dac3e34",
      "translationZh": "最后给棺材盖钉上钉子的，是 MiMo 在聊天中的文字表达，简直令人抓狂。还没到 Opus 那种令人抓狂的程度，但也差不多了。看着辣眼睛，而且经常得读 2 遍才能明白它到底在说什么鬼东西。GLM、DeepSeek 和 Qwen 用起来都舒服得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d35454cf1972117",
      "translationZh": "我让 MiMo-V2.6-Flash 做一次非常简单的 git 小手术：从 master 创建一个新分支，再从另一个分支 cherry-pick 一个提交。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3b292072be10f72",
      "translationZh": "然而，我没意识到，我指给它的那个 git worktree 已经损坏了（主 git 仓库里的那个分支是正常的）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f13b3dd27df1e62",
      "translationZh": "笨模型只会回复：“这里没有 git，我根本不知道你在说什么。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6dcbe2e6fcd3b26",
      "translationZh": "聪明一点的模型会注意到路径里有个 /worktrees/，对发生了什么做出有根据的推测，并提示我该怎么修复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "419a20fb9b86a3e0",
      "translationZh": "非常聪明的模型会注意到，沙箱里仅有的另一个目录就是主 git 仓库，其中有一个分支，与损坏的 worktree 目录同名，然后从那里将它恢复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1494a2fdc744b08a",
      "translationZh": "MiMo-V2.6-Flash 则陷入了一场长达 80k tokens 的迷幻之旅。它先是试图找到主 git 仓库，失败后便慌了神，一头钻进死胡同，开始乱动 /tmp、使用 mount --bind，以及做出其他疯狂操作。过了一阵子，我正纳闷到底出了什么鬼问题，才注意到这些。我怀疑，要是给它足够的时间，它可能会把我的主 git 仓库彻底毁掉；一想到如果没有沙箱限制，它可能会干出什么，我就不寒而栗。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4e405ae8dbc341f",
      "translationZh": "如果将现有的自行发布的基准测试结果与 Pro 的结果进行比较，据此下调 Pro 在 AA 上的智能水平来估算（这种方法非常粗糙，但能给出一个大致判断），MiMo-V2.6-Flash 就会显得与 GLM-5.3-Flash (high) 和 Qwen3.8-Flash 不相上下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57be14d45b44227b",
      "translationZh": "但事实绝对、明确不是如此。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c05209c5fa4ddc4",
      "translationZh": "千万不要为了 MiMo-V2.6-Flash 花钱买 Gorgon Halo。在 Strix Halo 上运行的 Qwen3.8-Flash 要好得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc3cfc5563aec30c",
      "translationZh": "我会继续用之前的模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b375dd4f2ab6d82",
      "translationZh": "DSv4.1 Flash 作为默认模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "733f984ccaa7cf67",
      "translationZh": "GLM-5.3-Flash (high) 作为极其便宜的选项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e56ba6ca4520274",
      "translationZh": "需要动用重型武器时使用 GLM-5.3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25ca6e76ca3c7a5e",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-Flash 和 Qwen3.8-27B 用于本地运行（我有一张 3080，所以 Flash 运行得很慢）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdeaea2a72f11cd3",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/crusaderky 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
